Subject: [PATCH] tofi: clamp wl_seat bind version for iosc

tofi 0.9.1 requests wl_seat version 7 unconditionally. iosc currently
advertises wl_seat version 5, and libwayland rejects the client bind before tofi
can map. tofi only needs v5-era seat/pointer/keyboard behavior here, so clamp
the client bind to the advertised version and at most v5.

diff -ruN -U3 a/src/main.c b/src/main.c
--- a/src/main.c	2025-11-11 00:00:00
+++ b/src/main.c	2026-07-07 00:00:00
@@ -643,11 +643,12 @@
 				4);
 		log_debug("Bound to compositor %u.\n", name);
 	} else if (!strcmp(interface, wl_seat_interface.name)) {
+		uint32_t seat_version = version < 5 ? version : 5;
 		tofi->wl_seat = wl_registry_bind(
 				wl_registry,
 				name,
 				&wl_seat_interface,
-				7);
+				seat_version);
 		wl_seat_add_listener(
 				tofi->wl_seat,
 				&wl_seat_listener,
